      <activity id="0aae4b93-d09d-599e-8846-b7f1c80e23f6" activityNameId="b857062f-0e19-5fc9-82d2-9536fa9f247a" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">3.5 MWp open ground installation, multi-Si, on open ground</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 3.5 MWp open ground installation, multi-Si, on open ground
Photovoltaic installation with a capacity of 3.5 MWp and a life time of 30 years installed in 2000 the US.;
Synonyms: polycrystalline, multi-crystalline, silicon; 
UUID: e55935d2-b44a-3170-bcd7-a1d5cb9dedd8
All components (modules, mounting system, electric installation, inverter, fence) for the installation of a 3.5 MWp photovoltaic plant, energy use for the mounting, transport of materials and persons to the construction place. Disposal of components after end of life.
Location: Installation in the US
Technology: Current technology for mounting of panels or laminates, electric installations and other components.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Study by Mason et al. 2006 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_e55935d2-b44a-3170-bcd7-a1d5cb9dedd8.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
